    <title>Kenya, UN ECA, AU-IBAR and IGAD launch national effort to build climate resilience in livestock, land and insurance systems</title>
    <link>https://www.uneca.org/stories/kenya%2C-un-eca%2C-au-ibar-and-igad-launch-national-effort-to-build-climate-resilience-in</link>
